From: FuSan21 <FuSan21@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:43:04 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] LTW: cross_device_service + MANAGE_CROSS_DEVICE +
 CrossDeviceManager fetcher

Link to Windows OEM integration, milestone 3 (phone-screen mirroring).

* SystemServer: register com.android.server.wm.CrossDeviceService as
  "cross_device_service" (port of OnePlus OxygenOS 15 CrossDeviceService).
* services.core: link ltw-crossdevice-aidl-server (vendor/ltw).
* framework-res: define deviceintegration.permission.MANAGE_CROSS_DEVICE
  (signature|privileged), as OnePlus does in oplus-framework-res.
* SystemServiceRegistry: getSystemService("cross_device_service") returns
  android.app.CrossDeviceManager loaded from the caller's ClassLoader
  (shared library com.microsoft.device-private), null otherwise.

Requires vendor/ltw from LinkToWindows-OEM (rom/).
